GET /radioChannel/search/{channelId} IRadioChannelService.rankedSearch | Ranked search across the songs, artists and albums configured on a channel. An empty query lists all configured content. | radioChannel | UserAuth | channelId:path,query:query,explicit:query,page:query,pageSize:query | body:no
POST /radioChannel/startChannel/{id} IRadioChannelService.startChannel | Start playing a channel. Returns a radio session id to feed into IRadioService.radioFlow. | radioChannel | UserAuth | id:path | body:no
DELETE /radioChannel/{type}/channelItem/{id} IRadioChannelService.removeChannelItem | Remove a song, artist or album from a channel's configured content. | radioChannel | UserAuth | id:path,type:path,itemId:query | body:no
